Payroll Policy 2026

Overview:
Ragverse HR maintains payroll policies for all full-time employees, including salary bands, bonus eligibility, and payroll update controls. Payroll changes require dual approval from HR and Finance.

Payroll Update Window:
- Standard processing window: 14th–18th of each month
- Off-cycle updates require VP approval and a documented change request

Salary Bands (Confidential):
- Associate: $70k–$95k
- Senior: $96k–$135k
- Staff: $136k–$185k

Access Controls:
- Payroll data is restricted to HR and Finance leadership
- HR analysts can view salary band guidance but not individual compensation
- Audit logs are retained for 7 years

Change Management:
All payroll adjustments must reference a change ticket ID and include justification, effective date, and approving manager.
